{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Zombie Brother","Protagonist XiaoFei used to be an ordinary guy from H city. After the spring water was contaminated with a virus, however, he unexpectedly encountered an unprecedented crisis. The people living in H City became zombies one by one, devouring each other, and gradually evolving. Can XiaoFei escape from H city and meet up with his girlfriend Wei? The story now begins..."],"ja":["尸兄",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":33357,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-30412","ids":{"shikimori":30412,"mal":30412,"anilist":99709,"kodik":"serial-41388"},"kodikIds":["serial-41388"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-41388":"2022-03-21T12:16:03Z"},"title":"Брат-зомби","originalTitle":"Shi xiong","alt":"Zombie Brother Zombie Brother 尸兄","description":"Главного героя этого китайского аниме зовут Бай Сяофэй , и он обычный парень из города H. В этом городе по неизвестной причине вода оказалась заражена страшными вирусом, который начал превращать людей в зомби. Теперь Бай Сяофэй в постоянной тревоге за свою жизнь пытается выбраться из родного города и найти свою пропавшею подругу Вэй. Вопрос только в том, удастся ли ему дойти до неё живым...","year":2014,"type":"ONA","genres":["Экшен","Комедия","Ужасы"],"rating":6.52,"popularity":894,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[33357],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/30412/612a65c17a7c69012be19cf44b107040.jpeg","width":432,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/c77c71e730f43ec1e839b869b676a791470cef58.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[10,20,30,41],"episodes":[{"number":10,"ordinal":10,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1080","dubId":"1080","label":"Aquanime","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-41388","translationId":"1080","url":"https://kodikpla